<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1575_5697.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frundtlich</unclear> grueß. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getruw</unclear> lieb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydt</unclear>: und
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pundtsgnosen</unclear>. Üwer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">letst</unclear> an uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethanes</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>schryben. Haben wir den <date resp="#ner">27ten. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> monats</date> empfang.
<lb n="4"/>daruß üwer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwe</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydt</unclear>: und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Pundtsgnoeßische</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolmeinung</unclear> abermaln <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vstand</unclear>. deren wir. sambt
