<lb n="12"/>und dulden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">moechten</unclear>. dz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gricht</unclear> nit allein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ingstelt</unclear>,
