<lb n="29"/>anders übertrangs. hat sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hie</unclear> niemandts <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuebsorg</unclear>.
<lb n="30"/>dann allen so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuem</unclear> rechten botten, sicher fry gleit
<lb n="31"/>(<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">menigklichen</unclear> wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuewüßen</unclear>.) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vheisen</unclear> und
